// Development build configuration.
// The anon key is safe to ship in the client by design (docs/07-security-model.md
// §7.1/§7.2) — it grants nothing without a valid user session and RLS.
// Never put the Supabase service role key or CLAUDE_API_KEY here or anywhere
// in the iOS app; those live only in Edge Function secrets.
// xcconfig treats a bare "//" as a comment start even mid-line, so URLs
// need the "$()" empty-macro trick below to keep the slashes intact.
SUPABASE_URL = https:/$()/YOUR-DEV-PROJECT.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = replace-with-your-dev-anon-key
